<title>NETHERLANDS: Kempen details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Kempen details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merchant Bank Kempen &amp; Co NV said on Thursday it had set its 1996 optional stock dividend at one new share per 40 held.</p>
<p>In February, the company announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 1.50 guilders, up from 0.80 in 1995. The payment could be taken up in cash or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Kempen's shares closed at 57.00 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Thursday, up one guilder from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
